      <h2 class="text-center px-3">How it works</h2>
      <div class="hiw-boxes-container row content-container mx-auto">
        <div class="hiw-box col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4">
          <a href="https://plasmidsaurus.com/home?join-the-pack=1" target="_blank">
            <img src="{{ 'img-create-an-account.png' | asset_url }}">
            <h4>Create an Account</h4>
          </a>
          <p>It’s free to join! Just log into Plasmidsaurus and click <a href="https://plasmidsaurus.com/home?join-the-pack=1" target="_blank">Join the Pack</a> to make an account on the Perks Store.</p>
        </div> 
        <div class="hiw-box col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4">
          <a href="https://app.plasmidsaurus.com/home" target="_blank">
            <img src="{{ 'img-earn-merch-points.png' | asset_url }}">
            <h4>Earn Merch Points</h4>
          </a>
          <p>Order sequencing and earn 1 point for every $1 you spend. Dinocoins count after they are spent, not when they are purchased.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hiw-box col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4">
          <a href="/products">
            <img src="{{ 'img-redeem-merch.png' | asset_url }}">
            <h4>Redeem Merch</h4>
          </a>
          <p>Monitor your point balance and redeem them by December 18.  Your items will ship by mid-February!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-the-wait-container content-container mx-auto px-3">
        <img src="{{ 'why-the-wait-graphic.png' | asset_url }}">
        <p><strong>Why the wait?</strong> At the moment we are running a pilot program and making our merch to order to only create exactly what our scientists ask for! Better for you and better for the planet.</p>
      </div>
