    <div class="faq-container">
      <img src="{{ 'faq-top-frame.png' | asset_url }}">
      <div class="faq-content-container">
        <div class="faq-content-innner content-container mx-auto px-3">
          <h2 class="mb-3">FAQs</h2>
          <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionFAQ">
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseOne" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseOne">
                  How do I join The Pack?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>This pilot round is invitation only. If you received an invite, log into your account and click <a href="https://plasmidsaurus.com/home?join-the-pack=1" target="_blank">Join the Pack</a>.</p>
                  <p> Didn't get an invite but want to stay in the loop? <a class="text-decoration-underline" href="https://rdwz4.share.hsforms.com/2kAnl9FVZQeSA0oDgKPTDpg" target="_blank">Sign up here</a> and you’ll be the first to know when The Pack opens up more broadly.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseTwo">
                  Who's eligible?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>Enrollment is open to life science professionals who are at least 18 as of their enrollment date, and who reside in the United States. Full details are in our <a class="text-decoration-underline" href="/pages/89242" target="_blank">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseThree">
                  How do I earn Merch Points?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p><a href="https://app.plasmidsaurus.com/home" target="_blank">Order sequencing</a> with the same account you used to sign up for the program. For every $1 of sequencing spent, you’ll automatically get 1 Merch Point. You'll also earn bonus Merch Points for <a href="https://plasmidsaurus.com/home?join-the-pack=1" target="_blank">registering your account</a>, <a href="https://share.hsforms.com/26POtpcLGRHSAI1bDtRWlNgrdwz4{% if current_user %}?email={{current_user.email}}{% endif %}" target="_blank">completing your profile</a>, and <a href="https://plasmidsaurus.com/" target="_blank">trying a service for the first time</a>.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseFour">
                  Do Dinocoins earn Merch Points?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>Dinocoins count towards your Merch Points only once they are converted into a sequencing purchase.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseFive">
                  How do I redeem my Merch Points?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p><a href="/account/login" style="text-decoration: underline;">Log in</a> to your account, <a href="/products" style="text-decoration: underline;">pick your reward</a>, and add to cart. Some items have limits per member to make sure we have enough going around, so grab your favorites while they last.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseSix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseSix">
                  Is there a cap on Merch Points?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>Yes, you’ll be capped at 30,000 per year.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!--
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseSeven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseSeven">
                  What about shipping?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>Shipping varies depending on the product and will be a maximum of $10. This cost will be listed at checkout.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
			-->
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseEight" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseEight">
                  When will my merch arrive?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseEight" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>For the pilot, all merch is made to order once the program wraps on December 18. You can expect delivery by mid-February.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseNine" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseNine">
                  Where can I check my balance?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseNine" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>You can check your balance in either your <a href="https://app.plasmidsaurus.com/settings/merch-points" style="text-decoration: underline;">Plasmidsaurus account</a> or your <a href="/account/balance" style="text-decoration: underline;">Perks account</a> settings.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-collapseTen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-collapseTen">
                  Can I transfer or combine Merch Points?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="faq-collapseTen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFAQ">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>Merch Points stay with the account that earned them.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
